#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-ae3.rst:494
msgid "Time‑of‑flight sensor"
msgstr "sensor แบบ time-of-flight"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-ae3.rst:496
msgid ""
"The AE3 carries a **VL53L8CX 8×8 multi‑zone time‑of‑flight sensor** that "
"returns up to 64 distance readings per frame, with a maximum range of ~4 m. "
"It's exposed through the :doc:`/library/omv.tof` module — call "
":func:`tof.init` to start the sensor and :func:`tof.read_depth` to grab a "
"depth frame as a flat list of millimetre readings (one per zone)::"
msgstr ""
